<item><title>EU caps Moroccan hybrid imports at 23,954 vehicles for 200 days</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/eu-caps-moroccan-hybrid-imports-at-23-954-vehicles-for-200-041282/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/eu-caps-moroccan-hybrid-imports-at-23-954-vehicles-for-200-041282/</guid><category>Morocco</category><description>The quota starts on December 1, after EU imports from Morocco reached 61,259 vehicles in the 12 months to June 2026.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:00:56 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/eu-caps-moroccan-hybrid-imports-at-23-954-vehicles-for-200-041282/share.jpg" length="43231" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/eu-caps-moroccan-hybrid-imports-at-23-954-vehicles-for-200-041282/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Laprophan raises 2,2 billion dirhams in Casablanca listing</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/laprophan-raises-2-2-billion-dirhams-in-casablanca-listing-b58a97/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/laprophan-raises-2-2-billion-dirhams-in-casablanca-listing-b58a97/</guid><category>Morocco</category><description>The Moroccan pharmaceutical group drew demand of 15,2 billion dirhams from 44 378 investors, nearly seven times the amount offered.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 18:47:13 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" length="33258" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
