<item><title>Morocco and Germany sign defence declaration covering arms and cyberdefence</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-and-germany-sign-defence-declaration-covering-arms-ae5ac2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-and-germany-sign-defence-declaration-covering-arms-ae5ac2/</guid><category>Morocco</category><description>The agreement also covers defence industry and space, while German officers’ participation in the African Lion 27 exercise is in preparation.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:21:37 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" length="33258" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
